{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"커플링","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"OQms5SAyOY"}],"key":"qVdNNUA5ad"},{"type":"text","value":"이 있다: 위치 j의 잔기가 위치 i의 잔기에 의해 (치환표로) 거의 결정된다. 10% 확률로 커플링이 깨진다(노이즈).","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"zHOCmWSDHe"}],"key":"ngoLFD8LrF"}],"key":"LVkWp6TBQH"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"작은 Transformer 인코더(PyTorch)를 MLM으로 학습한 뒤, ","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"ksPwUFPcDO"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"커플링 위치를 가렸을 때 파트너를 보고 맞히는지","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"g0TUZFtZvN"}],"key":"W3nnBORURj"},{"type":"text","value":"를 본다.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"wxsmlnBN5h"}],"key":"b4XkDftAIV"}],"key":"SCWlDrmxMz"}],"key":"kWxhiuoxMj"},{"type":"blockquote","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"실제 단백질의 공진화/접촉과 같은 현상을 ","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"ECast4QCyM"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"단순화한 장난감","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"AEQpSnOKHq"}],"key":"Pn2jDlcVtM"},{"type":"text","value":"이다. 수치가 실제 PLM의 성능을 뜻하지 않는다.\n이 아이디어의 실제 사례: Rao et al. 2021 (attention map이 contact를 학습함) — reading_list 02.","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"eO3NKjVBlR"}],"key":"pPF5ryxAjB"}],"key":"zjLGLhIGzM"}],"identifier":"cell-000","html_id":"cell-000","key":"CYKjcxJMcg"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:40:23.563823Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:40:23.563669Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.608634Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.608104Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"import math\nimport random\nimport time\n\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\n\nSEED = 0\nrandom.seed(SEED)\nnp.random.seed(SEED)\ntorch.manual_seed(SEED)\n# 주의: 같은 시드여도 MPS와 CPU는 난수 생성기·연산 순서가 달라 마스킹 패턴과 초기 가중치, 최종 수치가 약간 달라질 수 있다.\n# 정확한 비교가 필요하면 한 가지 장치로 고정하고, 결과는 시드 여러 개로 보고한다.\n\nDEVICE = torch.device(\"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\n# 모델이 매우 작아서 CPU가 더 빠를 수도 있다. 필요하면 아래 줄의 주석을 풀어 강제로 CPU 사용:\n# DEVICE = torch.device(\"cpu\")\nprint(\"device:\", DEVICE, \"| torch\", torch.__version__)","key":"dGJLcLOBYh"},{"type":"outputs","id":"pqr0FBM0zuVaTM9wT6V6n","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"device: mps | torch 2.15.0\n"},"children":[],"key":"xTW98x9ocR"}],"key":"e6adKjTfoc"}],"identifier":"cell-001","html_id":"cell-001","key":"bIlLKTBLje"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 합성 데이터","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"dXOocBT7uY"}],"identifier":"id-1","label":"1. 합성 데이터","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"Fx2C1p9ME0"}],"identifier":"cell-002","html_id":"cell-002","key":"Dy3jExybfz"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.610252Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.610093Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.688250Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.687651Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"AA = \"ACDEFGHIKLMNPQRSTVWY\"\nV = len(AA)          # 잔기 종류 20\nMASK_ID = V          # 마스크 토큰 id = 20\nL = 64               # 서열 길이\nN_PAIRS = 12\nNOISE = 0.1          # 커플링이 깨질 확률\n\nrs = np.random.RandomState(SEED)\nbackground = rs.dirichlet(np.ones(V) * 2.0)          # 비균일한 잔기 빈도\nperm_pos = rs.permutation(L)\nPAIRS = [(int(perm_pos[2 * k]), int(perm_pos[2 * k + 1])) for k in range(N_PAIRS)]  # (i, j): i가 j를 결정\nPERMS = [rs.permutation(V) for _ in range(N_PAIRS)]\ncoupled_positions = sorted({p for pair in PAIRS for p in pair})\nprint(\"coupled pairs (i->j):\", PAIRS[:4], \"...\")\nprint(\"coupled positions:\", len(coupled_positions), \"of\", L)\n\n\ndef sample(n, rs=rs):\n    X = rs.choice(V, size=(n, L), p=background)\n    for (i, j), pm in zip(PAIRS, PERMS):\n        keep = rs.rand(n) > NOISE\n        X[:, j] = np.where(keep, pm[X[:, i]], X[:, j])\n    return X\n\n\nX_train, X_test = sample(30000), sample(5000)\nprint(X_train.shape, X_test.shape)","key":"NYAly8gZda"},{"type":"outputs","id":"UepwpRWSw9jV4ysWBw_KS","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"coupled pairs (i->j): [(19, 1), (26, 8), (30, 39), (37, 47)] ...\ncoupled positions: 24 of 64\n(30000, 64) (5000, 64)\n"},"children":[],"key":"aQzupogL8q"}],"key":"Y7Rk5smNXg"}],"identifier":"cell-003","html_id":"cell-003","key":"hRGgd0lh4n"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 모델 — 직접 구현한 작은 Transformer 인코더","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"e6TNeAIoYf"}],"identifier":"id-2-transformer","label":"2. 모델 — 직접 구현한 작은 Transformer 인코더","html_id":"id-2-transformer","implicit":true,"key":"pl1r46Wq1G"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"attention 가중치를 꺼내 볼 수 있도록 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"FBrA1gQqh9"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"nn.MultiheadAttention","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"uBaPBY0Go6"},{"type":"text","value":"을 직접 사용한다.","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"NpMPL20OhE"}],"key":"RNOdxy5amK"}],"identifier":"cell-004","html_id":"cell-004","key":"aY1NjUYRRY"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.690234Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.690102Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.710308Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.709851Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"class Block(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, d, heads):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.ln1, self.ln2 = nn.LayerNorm(d), nn.LayerNorm(d)\n        self.attn = nn.MultiheadAttention(d, heads, batch_first=True)\n        self.ff = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(d, 4 * d), nn.GELU(), nn.Linear(4 * d, d))\n        self.last_attn = None\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        h = self.ln1(x)\n        a, w = self.attn(h, h, h, need_weights=True, average_attn_weights=False)\n        self.last_attn = w.detach()          # (batch, heads, L, L)\n        x = x + a\n        return x + self.ff(self.ln2(x))\n\n\nclass TinyMLM(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, d=64, heads=4, layers=2):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.tok = nn.Embedding(V + 1, d)    # 잔기 20 + 마스크 1\n        self.pos = nn.Embedding(L, d)        # 학습되는 위치 임베딩 (고정 길이)\n        self.blocks = nn.ModuleList([Block(d, heads) for _ in range(layers)])\n        self.ln = nn.LayerNorm(d)\n        self.out = nn.Linear(d, V)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        h = self.tok(x) + self.pos(torch.arange(x.size(1), device=x.device))\n        for b in self.blocks:\n            h = b(h)\n        return self.out(self.ln(h))\n\n\nmodel = TinyMLM().to(DEVICE)\nprint(\"parameters:\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))","key":"RDG6hfc7IC"},{"type":"outputs","id":"CaKScKQac5uBsypCFtxRW","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"parameters: 106836\n"},"children":[],"key":"glqcsyJHNL"}],"key":"ohaJfnH9jb"}],"identifier":"cell-005","html_id":"cell-005","key":"nLjGCxN4kX"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. MLM 학습","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"DCKv43GtoW"}],"identifier":"id-3-mlm","label":"3. MLM 학습","html_id":"id-3-mlm","implicit":true,"key":"T4BhfsHZf7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"각 위치를 15% 확률로 마스킹하고, 마스킹된 위치의 잔기만 예측한다 (BERT의 80/10/10 규칙은 단순화를 위해 생략).","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"AbdTtYGu7o"}],"key":"eGPzho07mS"}],"identifier":"cell-006","html_id":"cell-006","key":"P8Dozo4HWf"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.711837Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:40:24.711729Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:42:25.538811Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:42:25.538188Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"MASK_P = 0.15\nBATCH = 256\nSTEPS = 4000\nLR = 2e-3\n\nXtr = torch.from_numpy(X_train).long().to(DEVICE)\nopt = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=LR, weight_decay=0.01)\nsched = torch.optim.lr_scheduler.OneCycleLR(opt, max_lr=LR, total_steps=STEPS, pct_start=0.1)\n\nlosses = []\nt0 = time.time()\nmodel.train()\nfor step in range(STEPS):\n    idx = torch.randint(0, Xtr.size(0), (BATCH,), device=DEVICE)\n    x = Xtr[idx]\n    m = torch.rand(x.shape, device=DEVICE) < MASK_P\n    m[:, 0] |= ~m.any(dim=1)                       # 마스크가 하나도 없는 서열 방지\n    inp = x.masked_fill(m, MASK_ID)\n    logits = model(inp)\n    loss = F.cross_entropy(logits[m], x[m])\n    opt.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    loss.backward()\n    opt.step()\n    sched.step()\n    losses.append(loss.item())\n    if (step + 1) % 500 == 0:\n        print(f\"step {step + 1:5d}  loss {np.mean(losses[-500:]):.3f}  ({time.time() - t0:.0f}s)\")\n\nplt.figure(figsize=(4.5, 3))\nplt.plot(np.convolve(losses, np.ones(50) / 50, mode=\"valid\"))\nplt.xlabel(\"step\")\nplt.ylabel(\"MLM loss (smoothed)\")\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()","key":"R57l4Rw6QN"},{"type":"outputs","id":"kajLXhpb_o8kF37RXc4nW","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step   500  loss 2.705  (16s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"s79TuMK7hb"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step  1000  loss 2.244  (31s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"QFNpQcgdp6"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step  1500  loss 2.085  (46s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"fmDfG7Sezh"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step  2000  loss 2.035  (61s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"l8RFsJNhwN"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step  2500  loss 2.030  (75s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"U8kz7JS7z7"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step  3000  loss 2.028  (90s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"nEnBvQ4ucz"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step  3500  loss 2.027  (105s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"tRkSaaOJfu"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"step  4000  loss 2.028  (120s)\n"},"children":[],"key":"atGGCpvWy5"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"output_type":"display_data","metadata":{},"data":{"image/png":{"content_type":"image/png","hash":"86ccd416cc2922a8ba52bc6bd6c90f2a","path":"/biology-foundation-model-learning/_public/86ccd416cc2922a8ba52bc6bd6c90f2a.png"},"text/plain":{"content":"<Figure size 450x300 with 1 Axes>","content_type":"text/plain"}}},"children":[],"key":"VWDxL1Q6NK"}],"key":"BXK9gDjwGW"}],"identifier":"cell-007","html_id":"cell-007","key":"tHNDfz3rcP"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"학습 손실은 약 2.0 근처에서 평탄해진다(seed=0, 직접 확인). 0에 가까워지지 않는 이유를 생각해 보자. 비커플링 위치처럼 문맥으로 줄일 수 없는 불확실성의 하한은 무엇인가?","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"zrxjJyLrVD"}],"key":"n3DbM4f6aG"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. 평가 — 한 위치만 가렸을 때의 정확도","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"j99NYCFYgB"}],"identifier":"id-4","label":"4. 평가 — 한 위치만 가렸을 때의 정확도","html_id":"id-4","implicit":true,"key":"x8bcEWURoh"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"테스트 서열에서 위치 p 하나만 마스킹하고 정답 잔기를 맞히는 정확도를 위치별로 잰다.","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"aPcnv5DP78"}],"key":"m2oltTSvW8"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"비교 기준","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"l54O0QTdHi"}],"key":"v2zRqGsk3D"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"위치별 최빈값 baseline","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"E03Az9kMwV"}],"key":"sFxvQYobW2"},{"type":"text","value":": 훈련 데이터에서 위치 p에 가장 흔한 잔기를 항상 예측한다(문맥을 보지 않음).","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"qMGENNFZGb"}],"key":"EcVVFeBEnR"}],"key":"uhbYPGURnI"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"규칙 기반 기준","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"ceX7fg9i8M"}],"key":"WAs56XRvzH"},{"type":"text","value":": 커플링 규칙을 알고 파트너로부터 규칙대로 예측했을 때의 테스트 정확도다(표본 추정치).","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"Bqb6vwXZFA"}],"key":"aC4lOLCrOW"}],"key":"XMxKYwEWlM"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"베이즈 최적 정확도(이론 상한)","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"WXqVuMErP7"}],"key":"GdtxVjFmr9"},{"type":"text","value":": 데이터 생성 과정을 정확히 알 때 파트너가 주어진 상태에서 달성 가능한 최대 정확도다. 결합분포에서 직접 계산한다.\n규칙 기반 예측이 항상 베이즈 최적이라는 보장은 없다. 위치별 배경 빈도가 치우쳐 있으면 달라질 수 있어 따로 계산한다.","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"KYcsoVKec8"}],"key":"qoPqQNel9X"}],"key":"uKhgG67ETT"}],"key":"vDRbwG3o2P"}],"identifier":"cell-008","html_id":"cell-008","key":"i7Sci17K8J"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:42:25.540746Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:42:25.540587Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:42:34.492780Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:42:34.492262Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"@torch.no_grad()\ndef acc_single_mask(model, X, p, bs=1000):\n    model.eval()\n    Xt = torch.from_numpy(X).long().to(DEVICE)\n    correct = 0\n    for s in range(0, Xt.size(0), bs):\n        x = Xt[s:s + bs].clone()\n        y = x[:, p].clone()\n        x[:, p] = MASK_ID\n        correct += (model(x)[:, p].argmax(-1) == y).sum().item()\n    return correct / Xt.size(0)\n\n\nmodel_acc = np.array([acc_single_mask(model, X_test, p) for p in range(L)])\n\nmode_pred = np.array([np.bincount(X_train[:, p], minlength=V).argmax() for p in range(L)])\nbase_acc = np.array([(X_test[:, p] == mode_pred[p]).mean() for p in range(L)])\n\nrule_acc, bayes_acc = {}, {}\nfor (i, j), pm in zip(PAIRS, PERMS):\n    inv = np.argsort(pm)\n    rule_acc[j] = (pm[X_test[:, i]] == X_test[:, j]).mean()      # 규칙 기반: i로부터 j 예측\n    rule_acc[i] = (inv[X_test[:, j]] == X_test[:, i]).mean()     # 규칙 기반: j로부터 i 예측\n    # 생성 과정으로부터 결합분포 P(x_i=a, x_j=b)를 만들어 이론적 베이즈 최적 정확도를 계산한다.\n    joint = background[:, None] * NOISE * background[None, :]   # 노이즈: x_j가 배경에서 독립 추출됨\n    joint[np.arange(V), pm] += background * (1 - NOISE)         # 커플링: x_j = pm[x_i]\n    bayes_acc[j] = joint.max(axis=1).sum()                      # i가 주어졌을 때 j를 맞힐 최대 확률\n    bayes_acc[i] = joint.max(axis=0).sum()                      # j가 주어졌을 때 i를 맞힐 최대 확률\n\ncp = np.array(coupled_positions)\nunc = np.array([p for p in range(L) if p not in set(coupled_positions)])\nprint(f\"coupled positions   : model {model_acc[cp].mean():.3f} | position-mode baseline {base_acc[cp].mean():.3f} | \"\n      f\"rule-based {np.mean([rule_acc[p] for p in cp]):.3f} | Bayes-optimal (theory) {np.mean([bayes_acc[p] for p in cp]):.3f}\")\nprint(f\"uncoupled positions : model {model_acc[unc].mean():.3f} | position-mode baseline {base_acc[unc].mean():.3f}\")\n\ncolors = [\"tab:red\" if p in set(coupled_positions) else \"tab:gray\" for p in range(L)]\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(9, 3))\nax.bar(range(L), model_acc, color=colors)\nax.plot(range(L), base_acc, \"k.\", label=\"position-mode baseline\")\nax.set_xlabel(\"position (red = coupled)\")\nax.set_ylabel(\"accuracy (single mask)\")\nax.legend()\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()","key":"w2zMtZNVQ1"},{"type":"outputs","id":"1TvZeb9OXlJnjyTvzZiI-","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"coupled positions   : model 0.907 | position-mode baseline 0.129 | rule-based 0.907 | Bayes-optimal (theory) 0.905\nuncoupled positions : model 0.128 | position-mode baseline 0.128\n"},"children":[],"key":"aLfkWTljBB"},{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"output_type":"display_data","metadata":{},"data":{"image/png":{"content_type":"image/png","hash":"5085cf04472062c4ead9646431f0a134","path":"/biology-foundation-model-learning/_public/5085cf04472062c4ead9646431f0a134.png"},"text/plain":{"content":"<Figure size 900x300 with 1 Axes>","content_type":"text/plain"}}},"children":[],"key":"Uft0vMB4yu"}],"key":"oW61dh5wnZ"}],"identifier":"cell-009","html_id":"cell-009","key":"TuQstlFWjV"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"읽는 법","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"yBm1vrInDS"}],"key":"wGTzzZ8ecY"},{"type":"text","value":": 빨간 막대(커플링 위치)가 baseline 점(검은 점)보다 훨씬 높고 회색(비커플링)은 baseline 근처라면,\n모델이 ","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"JoqAxTwGOk"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"마스킹된 위치의 파트너 잔기를 찾아 활용하는 법","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"d87hcuZ5Vl"}],"key":"J9a0xXI60O"},{"type":"text","value":"을 MLM 목적함수만으로 학습한 것이다.\n비커플링 위치는 문맥에서 얻을 정보가 없으므로 baseline(위치별 최빈값)이 사실상 상한이다.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"pEE2dBVeIj"}],"key":"mhdd77OArV"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"참고: 모델·규칙 기반 값은 5,000개 테스트 서열에서 얻은 ","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"hoV0DqZBNo"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"표본 추정치","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"Kon1uwAJoq"}],"key":"dYkF7wuUek"},{"type":"text","value":"(표준오차 약 0.004)이고 베이즈 최적값은 이론값이다.\n추정치가 이론 상한을 0.002 정도 넘는 것은 모델이 상한을 이긴 것이 아니라 표본 오차 범위 안의 차이다.","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"XT54VJtTVa"}],"key":"uEd6OTKQQo"}],"identifier":"cell-010","html_id":"cell-010","key":"BHfRikSIEp"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"5. attention은 파트너를 보는가? (양방향)","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"wxQkr89oay"}],"identifier":"id-5-attention","label":"5. attention은 파트너를 보는가? (양방향)","html_id":"id-5-attention","implicit":true,"key":"ZRFqCvjZYw"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"커플링 위치 하나(target)를 마스킹하고, target에서 나가는 attention이 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"ppxJky0xO3"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"파트너","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"v4HUmCvoAB"}],"key":"zOtjUERPDY"},{"type":"text","value":"에 얼마나 집중되는지 본다. 쌍 (i, j)에 대해 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"G354QyQRtF"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"두 방향","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"d6hGjTTqsu"}],"key":"ev5qSxGB4Y"},{"type":"text","value":"을 모두 잰다:\nj를 마스킹했을 때 i를 보는가, i를 마스킹했을 때 j를 보는가.\n(지표: 파트너에 대한 attention ÷ 나머지 위치 평균 attention, 헤드 평균·샘플 평균)","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"P4UBaRTYpo"}],"key":"LJ6u3LpMjc"}],"identifier":"cell-011","html_id":"cell-011","key":"OHDq2UiTsM"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:42:34.494276Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:42:34.494162Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:42:35.215498Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:42:35.215058Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"@torch.no_grad()\ndef partner_attention_ratio(model, X, target, partner, n=1000):\n    model.eval()\n    x = torch.from_numpy(X[:n]).long().to(DEVICE).clone()\n    x[:, target] = MASK_ID\n    model(x)\n    ratios = []\n    for b in model.blocks:\n        a = b.last_attn[:, :, target, :].mean(dim=(0, 1)).cpu().numpy()   # target에서 나가는 attention (L,)\n        others = np.delete(a, [partner, target])\n        ratios.append(a[partner] / others.mean())\n    return ratios\n\n\ndirected = [(j, i) for (i, j) in PAIRS] + [(i, j) for (i, j) in PAIRS]    # (target, partner): 앞 12개는 j<-i, 뒤 12개는 i<-j\nratios = np.array([partner_attention_ratio(model, X_test, t, pr) for (t, pr) in directed])\nprint(\"layer1 / layer2 의 '파트너 attention ÷ 나머지 평균'\")\nfor k, (i, j) in enumerate(PAIRS):\n    print(f\"  pair ({i:2d},{j:2d})   j가 target: {ratios[k][0]:6.2f} {ratios[k][1]:6.2f}   |   i가 target: {ratios[12 + k][0]:6.2f} {ratios[12 + k][1]:6.2f}\")\nprint(\"평균 (j가 target):\", np.round(ratios[:12].mean(0), 2), \"| 평균 (i가 target):\", np.round(ratios[12:].mean(0), 2))","key":"QExoslTNsN"},{"type":"outputs","id":"fqoMcHn7euw_UjPcr92Sm","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"layer1 / layer2 의 '파트너 attention ÷ 나머지 평균'\n  pair (19, 1)   j가 target:  37.69   9.86   |   i가 target:   1.75  38.66\n  pair (26, 8)   j가 target:  33.31   2.20   |   i가 target:  42.76   2.97\n  pair (30,39)   j가 target:  24.30   3.72   |   i가 target:  50.33   2.78\n  pair (37,47)   j가 target:  36.47  17.63   |   i가 target:  34.47   1.19\n  pair (44,28)   j가 target:  34.14   3.09   |   i가 target:  19.45  16.12\n  pair (41,57)   j가 target:  20.91   8.62   |   i가 target:  28.22   2.14\n  pair (43,49)   j가 target:  20.18   5.92   |   i가 target:  21.34   5.86\n  pair (22,34)   j가 target:   6.40  46.42   |   i가 target:   1.43  30.93\n  pair (29, 9)   j가 target:  15.17  43.73   |   i가 target:  28.81   0.92\n  pair ( 7,24)   j가 target:   1.43  35.92   |   i가 target:  17.35  26.51\n  pair (62,10)   j가 target:  42.44  15.68   |   i가 target:  23.85   2.96\n  pair (25,45)   j가 target:  22.17   1.13   |   i가 target:  21.54   1.75\n평균 (j가 target): [24.55 16.16] | 평균 (i가 target): [24.28 11.07]\n"},"children":[],"key":"gWrZn4CDoy"}],"key":"K6aVWOvOkJ"}],"identifier":"cell-012","html_id":"cell-012","key":"J7Z2Hd19Yy"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"해석 가이드","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"yFYoBQAiW6"}],"key":"HYu5pq75Bg"},{"type":"text","value":": 비율이 1보다 크면 파트너에 평균 이상으로 attention이 모인다는 뜻이다. 층이나 헤드마다 역할이 다를 수 있고(헤드 평균은 희석 